 placement lost, nothing restored. The pavilion seen on the bridge before
 0932b6b was the r5h3 ASSETS template LK_pavilion at the origin (= bridge
 centre; hide_render, never in the r5h3 render; 0932b6b filtered it, 0cbce91
 stopped exporting it). The only real placement LK_pavilion_i (13.6, 0.55,
 -4.6, right shore) is kept (431 instances) and lies just outside the r5h3
 board camera (min NDC x 1.029) and all aligned board cameras, as in
 lakeside_r5h3_demo_lastframe.png. Guard test lakeside-pavilion

---
 tools/journey-integration/run-suite.cjs   |  2 +-
 tools/lakeside/test_lakeside_pavilion.cjs | 30 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 31 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 tools/lakeside/test_lakeside_pavilion.cjs

